# Web3Forms access key for the contact form.
# 1. Sign up free at https://web3forms.com (enter the inbox you want messages sent to).
# 2. Copy your Access Key below.
# 3. Locally: copy this file to .env.local and fill it in.
# 4. On Vercel: add the same variable under Project Settings → Environment Variables, then redeploy.
NEXT_PUBLIC_WEB3FORMS_ACCESS_KEY=your-access-key-here
